examples:
判断类型是否为整型：

```cpp
if (is_integral<int>::value) {
    cout << "int is integral" << endl;
} else {
    cout << "int is not integral" << endl;
}
```

判断 string 是否为类类型：

```cpp
if (is_class<string>::value) {
    cout << "string is a class" << endl;
} else {
    cout << "string is not a class" << endl;
}
```
